{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FUTURE OF FPV</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EreaDrone</strong>, the most versatile FPV drone simulator ever made. Experience <strong>ultra-realistic physics</strong>, <strong>race in massive 5km environments</strong>, or <strong>build your own world</strong> with a professional-grade map editor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/9248b72118a99aac773ec968d85a4ce0.webp?t=1766113707\" width=616 height=28 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/1dc021206c2e388e83f75a658ed49321.poster.avif?t=1766113707\" width=720 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/1dc021206c2e388e83f75a658ed49321.webm?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/1dc021206c2e388e83f75a658ed49321.mp4?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/690fbb964a9e3f79cf0debadc1a55283.webp?t=1766113707\" width=614 height=7 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BEST EDRONE EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EreaDrone has been thought to be the best FPV drone game while being easy to use. The simulator has been developed by pilots, but not only for pilots! For players too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play, race and freestyle with your friends, all around the world! Create <strong>multiplayer</strong> lobbies, or join them, and fly up to 8 pilots simultaneously with <strong>12 spectators</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/9248b72118a99aac773ec968d85a4ce0.webp?t=1766113707\" width=616 height=28 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/bd45f0b2a123948f9bcb406bac1b7648.poster.avif?t=1766113707\" width=720 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/bd45f0b2a123948f9bcb406bac1b7648.webm?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/bd45f0b2a123948f9bcb406bac1b7648.mp4?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/690fbb964a9e3f79cf0debadc1a55283.webp?t=1766113707\" width=614 height=7 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHYSICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beginner or experienced real FPV drone pilot? Looking for realism? With our collaboration with the <strong>ISAE-ENSMA (French national superior school of mechanic and aerotechnics)</strong>, try out our <strong>realistic physics</strong>: you will not even notice you are in a simulator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/9248b72118a99aac773ec968d85a4ce0.webp?t=1766113707\" width=616 height=28 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/3df14692fab84a112e54458def79009d.poster.avif?t=1766113707\" width=720 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/3df14692fab84a112e54458def79009d.webm?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/3df14692fab84a112e54458def79009d.mp4?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/690fbb964a9e3f79cf0debadc1a55283.webp?t=1766113707\" width=614 height=7 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAP EDITOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the <strong>map editor</strong>, create maps and tracks of all kinds, for freestyle and racing! Share them easily with other players with one click! Your imagination is the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/9248b72118a99aac773ec968d85a4ce0.webp?t=1766113707\" width=616 height=28 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/b741b6071b394bdd22b57676fc5b08f7.poster.avif?t=1766113707\" width=720 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/b741b6071b394bdd22b57676fc5b08f7.webm?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/b741b6071b394bdd22b57676fc5b08f7.mp4?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/690fbb964a9e3f79cf0debadc1a55283.webp?t=1766113707\" width=614 height=7 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENVIRONMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly in <strong>16 different environments</strong>! Meadow, carpark, suburb, contruction site, stadium, school, mountains, and many more to come! Some of them being up to 5km wide, you will never get bored in these environments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HUGE OUTDOORS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly in 5km wide environments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/9248b72118a99aac773ec968d85a4ce0.webp?t=1766113707\" width=616 height=28 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/7c08b0a7f83a70e2d67adaf5296cf8e0.poster.avif?t=1766113707\" width=720 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/7c08b0a7f83a70e2d67adaf5296cf8e0.webm?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/7c08b0a7f83a70e2d67adaf5296cf8e0.mp4?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/690fbb964a9e3f79cf0debadc1a55283.webp?t=1766113707\" width=614 height=7 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TIME AND WEATHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to fly on a stormy night? On a sunny morning? Chose your outdoor environments' time of day and weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/9248b72118a99aac773ec968d85a4ce0.webp?t=1766113707\" width=616 height=28 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/eb88a75980668c5dea1f38e22a79cda9.poster.avif?t=1766113707\" width=720 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/eb88a75980668c5dea1f38e22a79cda9.webm?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/eb88a75980668c5dea1f38e22a79cda9.mp4?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/690fbb964a9e3f79cf0debadc1a55283.webp?t=1766113707\" width=614 height=7 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First session","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301060/5d7ada0405441afeb93f6edf96dbc7357509c7ab.jpg"},{"name":"100 Gates","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301060/d55f887c6e6b23f8264c78830603160e0d9a458e.jpg"},{"name":"1000 Gates","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301060/4d6a1ac85d6789ae7f85c737bde27a37f042e5bd.jpg"},{"name":"5000 Gates","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301060/b32454520a9e8b75f42a8e2080cbdd57cd600156.jpg"},{"name":"10000 Gates","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301060/9584170ae6ce83ba86da53d9050602712a9477d1.jpg"},{"name":"Freestyle session","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301060/c968cdb63434deb27474212d9a7e7628e4deeeba.jpg"},{"name":"10 Laps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301060/ef97fa83a333ad959a8e48df28a2e9bba676a98b.jpg"},{"name":"50 Laps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301060/2b59fa1e0fc4eefdc6d182ea43a2b7bb8f4fb369.jpg"},{"name":"200 Laps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301060/615c4a4677acb23474b4752aefe5e8186a41485c.jpg"},{"name":"1000 Laps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1301060/f09b2369fac153ddd607842f061739bfac533959.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1301060?t=1766113707","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766113707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/46b1ddec8ade9d2a8b0acffea997deeff2c65356/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1766113707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/46b1ddec8ade9d2a8b0acffea997deeff2c65356/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1766113707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics V2 Release</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After months of research and feedback, we are pleased to release <strong>Physics V2</strong>! Check it out now on EreaDrone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See more:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/63c2143364486ff59706d06cb341b948.avif?t=1766113707\" width=1560 height=1132 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FUTURE OF FPV</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EreaDrone</strong>, the most versatile FPV drone simulator ever made. Experience <strong>ultra-realistic physics</strong>, <strong>race in massive 5km environments</strong>, or <strong>build your own world</strong> with a professional-grade map editor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/9248b72118a99aac773ec968d85a4ce0.webp?t=1766113707\" width=616 height=28 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/1dc021206c2e388e83f75a658ed49321.poster.avif?t=1766113707\" width=720 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/1dc021206c2e388e83f75a658ed49321.webm?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/1dc021206c2e388e83f75a658ed49321.mp4?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/690fbb964a9e3f79cf0debadc1a55283.webp?t=1766113707\" width=614 height=7 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BEST EDRONE EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EreaDrone has been thought to be the best FPV drone game while being easy to use. The simulator has been developed by pilots, but not only for pilots! For players too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play, race and freestyle with your friends, all around the world! Create <strong>multiplayer</strong> lobbies, or join them, and fly up to 8 pilots simultaneously with <strong>12 spectators</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/9248b72118a99aac773ec968d85a4ce0.webp?t=1766113707\" width=616 height=28 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/bd45f0b2a123948f9bcb406bac1b7648.poster.avif?t=1766113707\" width=720 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/bd45f0b2a123948f9bcb406bac1b7648.webm?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/bd45f0b2a123948f9bcb406bac1b7648.mp4?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/690fbb964a9e3f79cf0debadc1a55283.webp?t=1766113707\" width=614 height=7 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHYSICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beginner or experienced real FPV drone pilot? Looking for realism? With our collaboration with the <strong>ISAE-ENSMA (French national superior school of mechanic and aerotechnics)</strong>, try out our <strong>realistic physics</strong>: you will not even notice you are in a simulator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/9248b72118a99aac773ec968d85a4ce0.webp?t=1766113707\" width=616 height=28 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/3df14692fab84a112e54458def79009d.poster.avif?t=1766113707\" width=720 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/3df14692fab84a112e54458def79009d.webm?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/3df14692fab84a112e54458def79009d.mp4?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/690fbb964a9e3f79cf0debadc1a55283.webp?t=1766113707\" width=614 height=7 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAP EDITOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the <strong>map editor</strong>, create maps and tracks of all kinds, for freestyle and racing! Share them easily with other players with one click! Your imagination is the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/9248b72118a99aac773ec968d85a4ce0.webp?t=1766113707\" width=616 height=28 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/b741b6071b394bdd22b57676fc5b08f7.poster.avif?t=1766113707\" width=720 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/b741b6071b394bdd22b57676fc5b08f7.webm?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301060/extras/b741b6071b394bdd22b57676fc5b08f7.mp4?t=1766113707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"b